#!/usr/bin/env sh

cat <<'EOF'
open-kernel development commands

Environment
  nix develop              Enter the development shell.
  direnv allow             Allow the repository .envrc; adds scripts/ to PATH.

Build
  build-iso                Build build/open-kernel.iso with GRUB.
  build-limine-iso         Build build/open-kernel-limine.iso with Limine.

Run
  qemu-system-x86_64 -cdrom build/open-kernel.iso
  run-grub                 Build the GRUB ISO and start it in QEMU.
  run-lim                  Build the Limine ISO and start it in QEMU.

Nix
  nix develop              Open the development shell without direnv.
  nix flake check          Evaluate and check the development flake.

Run this help again with: help
EOF
